  <p id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">永泰元年春正月癸未朔</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">丁未，誅河東王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0007" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_D">鉉</persName>、臨賀王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0012" ref="kix_r92_2ed_L">子岳</persName>、西陽王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0018" ref="kix_r92_2ed_M">子文</persName>、衡陽王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0024" ref="kix_r92_2ed_J">子峻</persName>、南康王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0030" ref="kix_r92_2ed_B">子琳</persName>、永陽王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0036" ref="kix_r92_2ed_N">子珉</persName>、湘東王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0042" ref="kix_r92_2ed_O">子建</persName>、南郡王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0048" ref="kix_r92_2ed_P">子夏</persName>、桂楊王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0054" ref="ipq_o9t_wdh_B">昭粲</persName>、巴陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-lastprinces-qi6:p002:m0060" ref="ipq_o9t_wdh_A">昭秀</persName>。</p>
